<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n77353" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Πᾰνελλ-ήνιος</span></b> 
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Ζεύς, ὁ</span>, the
		chief god <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>of the</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Πανέλληνες</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					11
				</span></i>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Paus.
				1.18.9
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				1.44.9
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				2.29.8
			</span></i>; also <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀγὼν Π.</span> his
			festival, <i><span class="en">
				<u>IG</u>
				22.1077.14
			</span></i>; cf. <i><span class="en">
				111
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Πᾰνελλήνιον</span></b> , τό, <i>his temple</i>, at Aegina, built by
			Hadrian as their meeting-place, <i><span class="en">
				Paus.
				2.30.4
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				D.C.
				69.16
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>body of</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Πανέλληνες</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					11
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὸ κοινὸν τοῦ Π.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>CIG</u>
					3832
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				3834
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>III.</b>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὰ</span>
		</div>
